%% Hand-authored projection of HerdrBusyHandoff r2, not generated state-space output.
%% Production SHA 1fe3a57d266e1e7fe384796d22a925076f1d99fc; 31 cfg / 136 TLC runs.
stateDiagram-v2
    [*] --> IntakeProbe: incoming original
    IntakeProbe --> Begin: CommitIntake / current journal recheck
    IntakeProbe --> Blocked: BeforeActiveEntry RED / no Bound row
    Begin --> Stopping: durable unfinished_handoff and owner
    Stopping --> Retained: BeforeReadyRefusal RED / main unread
    Stopping --> OldSelected: StopFailed then ChooseOld
    OldSelected --> Revalidating: ReleaseOldNoKey / positive proof and zero keys
    Revalidating --> Stopping: RevalidateOld / fresh identity
    OldSelected --> OldArmed: Arm / readable existing draft guard
    OldArmed --> OldReceipt: Submit / first key fixes destination
    OldReceipt --> OldSettled: Confirm / exact receipt
    OldSettled --> OldCompleted: OldProcessingTerminal
    OldCompleted --> Stopping: OldFallbackComplete / migration without replay
    Stopping --> Checking: ClosePinnedPane / same server connection
    Checking --> OldEnded: ProviderEnds then VerifyOldAbsent
    Stopping --> OldEnded: verified old object already ended
    OldEnded --> Pending: Launch / latest native ID, not argv UUID
    Pending --> Created: Create / same native ID, new nonce
    Created --> Bound: OwnResumeStartAndAttach / durable source
    Bound --> NewSelected: ChooseNew / unused first-input epoch
    NewSelected --> FirstHeld: NewPreKeyRefused / typed Held and proof
    FirstHeld --> NewSelected: NativeReadyWake / level recheck, same original
    NewSelected --> NewArmed: Arm / native capability, owner gate
    NewArmed --> NewReceipt: Submit / one framed RPC
    NewReceipt --> Done: Confirm
    Done --> Complete: FinishJournal / no remaining originals
    Begin --> Cancelled: CancelBeforeKey / explicit control
    NewArmed --> Cancelled: CancelBeforeKey / positive zero-key proof
    OldArmed --> Cancelled: CancelBeforeKey / positive zero-key proof
    Cancelled --> Complete: FinishJournal after migration and queue settlement
    note right of IntakeProbe
      Active marker-absent entry reaches Begin before hand_busy.
      N=2 probe/commit interleavings test stale-marker bypass.
    end note
    note right of OldSelected
      OldUnread stays constant: no RecoverScreen fairness.
      C-s or any first key forbids destination release.
      Existing draft guard is unchanged; DraftEnter mutant is RED.
    end note
    note right of Checking
      Pane ID is a capability only on the same live connection.
      EOF invalidates it; no numeric PID signal or blind reconnect.
      Close acknowledgment is not provider end or transcript flush.
    end note
    note right of FirstHeld
      No string conversion, no retained, no screen-only watcher.
      Native hook is own resume/ID/nonce/source evidence.
      Human unsent editing in the new pane remains deferred policy.
    end note
    state RestartRecovery {
      [*] --> Down: Crash at any modeled effect
      Down --> ActorSelected: BootCensus / input OR unfinished journal
      ActorSelected --> Awake: BootWake / separate action
      Awake --> Recovered: receipt or positive no-key evidence
    }
    note right of RestartRecovery
      Journal-only starts with all inputs already done.
      A lost connection must be freshly verified, never restored as authority.
      Permanent post-content receipt loss remains LostReceipt RED.
    end note
    Complete --> [*]
